In order for an application hosted on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> to connect to a remote server, whether a database or another type of application, that remote server must be accessible from the internet and allow traffic from our servers' IP addresses (listed in section 3.8.3 <http://docs.rstudio.com/shinyapps.io/applications.html#accessing-your-local-databases-from-shinyapps.io> of the user guide).

If you share a bit more about your situation, I could try to make a recommendation about what to do.

